      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تهاترا</span></b>  <i>They accused each other falsely.</i> (S,
A, Mgh, Msb, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And hence, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تهاترت</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">البَيِّنَاتُ</span>, (Msb,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشَّهَادَاتُ</span>, (A, Mgh,) <i>The
testimonies,</i> or <i>evidences, became null:</i> (Mgh,
Msb:) or <i>belied one another.</i> (A.)

